 11, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "A study supported by NIH found that a new MRI contrast agent may make small lung cancer tumors easier to see. \n\nThe new agent allowed researchers to detect some tumors in mice that CT scans missed. With further development, it could help doctors detect small lung tumors and https://t.co/uOyQUYqIZ2", "url": "https://x.com/NIH/status/2115849156895855066"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:45:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115847511713702053"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "A new atlas of colorectal tumors sheds light on why cancers in young people are more dangerous.", "display_url": "statnews.com/2026/10/29/ear…", "end": 201, "expanded_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/29/early-onset-colorectal-cancer-dana-farber-study-qa-kimmie-ng/", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115753034194034688/XKKPtEV4?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115753034194034688/XKKPtEV4?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 178, "status": 200, "title": "New atlas of colorectal tumors sheds light on why cancers in young people are more dangerous", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/29/early-onset-colorectal-cancer-dana-farber-study-qa-kimmie-ng/", "url": "https://t.co/BpcCrZmnaJ"}]}, "id": "2115847511713702053", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1519, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New atlas of colorectal tumors sheds light on why cancers in young people are more dangerous. The database includes 189 tumors from patients ranging from their 20s to their 90s. https://t.co/BpcCrZmnaJ", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2115847511713702053"}, {"author_id": "28164923", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:40:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115846241120587940"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Prop. 40, on the ballot Tuesday, represents the closest the group of “nerdy academics” has come with a wealth tax.", "display_url": "on.wsj.com/4yQzDzZ", "end": 125, "expanded_url": "https://on.wsj.com/4yQzDzZ", "images": [{"height": 640, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115846244006277121/9gS-6W3r?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115846244006277121/9gS-6W3r?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 102, "status": 200, "title": "The Four Academics Who Dreamed Up California’s Billionaire Tax", "unwound_url": "https://www.wsj.com/finance/the-four-academics-who-dreamed-up-californias-billionaire-tax-b0d05dcc?reflink=e2twmkts", "url": "https://t.co/co2oZbcsfF"}]}, "id": "2115846241120587940", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 7079, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meet the four academics who dreamed up California’s billionaire tax on the ballot Tuesday as Prop. 40 https://t.co/co2oZbcsfF", "url": "https://x.com/WSJmarkets/status/2115846241120587940"}, {"author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:37:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115845497563083128"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Mutations accumulate in cells with age, while caloric restriction extends lifespan across diverse animals. Grońska-Pęski et al. study the effect of caloric restriction on mutations genome-wide in mice, finding reduced mutation burdens across several tissues and cell types, thereby establishing that diet can alter mutation accumulation genome-wide during aging.", "display_url": "cell.com/cell/abstract/…", "end": 241, "expanded_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/abstract/S0092-8674(26)00940-2", "images": [{"height": 375, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115827089396080640/KY25As16?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 375}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115827089396080640/KY25As16?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 218, "status": 200, "title": "Caloric restriction modulates genome-wide somatic mutation in mice", "unwound_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/abstract/S0092-8674(26)00940-2", "url": "https://t.co/H7MQfq75Gk"}, {"description": "In this issue of Cell, Grońska-Pęski et al. examine how calorie restriction (CR) affects DNA mutation rates. While CR lowers the accumulation of mutations, this effect does not scale with the degree of lifespan extension. Their work raises important new questions about how CR impacts the causal mechanisms of aging.", "display_url": "cell.com/cell/abstract/…", "end": 265, "expanded_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/abstract/S0092-8674(26)01140-2", "images": [{"height": 438, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115845500884930560/zT64e35c?format=png&name=orig", "width": 876}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115845500884930560/zT64e35c?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 242, "status": 200, "title": "Calorie restriction uncouples mutation rate from lifespan", "unwound_url": "https://www.cell.com/cell/abstract/S0092-8674(26)01140-2", "url": "https://t.co/YA2FzC7FQZ"}]}, "id": "2115845497563083128", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 20357, "like_count": 153, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 33}, "text": "Caloric restriction (CR), in many species, extends lifespan. In a new study, CR reduced the accumulation of somatic mutations, but that was not enough to account for change in lifespan. Work in the experimental model.\nhttps://t.co/H7MQfq75Gk\nhttps://t.co/YA2FzC7FQZ", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2115845497563083128"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:25:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115842482135040015"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - The theoretical objects would have left a larger imprint on cosmic radiation if they were a source of the invisible force